\n- [@SelaVie#5052](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#selavie#5052) - Toronto 🇨🇦\n- [@KNVL.#7556](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#knvl.#7556) - Kenya 🇰🇪\n- [@Kari’m#9263](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#karim#9263) - Detroit 🇺🇸\n- [@ChinoStaySolow#8122](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#chinostaysolow#8122) - Providence 🇺🇸\n- [@KEVLAR REX#5427](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#kevlar-rex#5427) - Atlanta 🇺🇸\n- [@hiimjae#7572](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#hiimjae#7572)\n- [@DjQueRico#9286](/episodes/soulection-and-chill-discord-edition-2021/#djquerico#9286) - Knoxville 🇺🇸\n\n\nArtwork by [joemaloof#3534](https://www.instagram.com/jjjjoemaloof/)\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-02-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"@DjQueRico#9286","position":8}},{"id":"nSPc-Ws-Iig","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - You want You need","track":{"id":"OVU15Hj0vxo","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/you-want-you-need/","slug":"you-want-you-need","title":"You want You need","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/you-want-you-need.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":3}},{"id":"MQirrzUTWkQ","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Any Time!","track":{"id":"LMECrx3rd5U","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time/","slug":"any-time","title":"Any Time!","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/166.jpg","content":"ESTA., The Whooligan and Joe Kay five you a special sonic experiance.\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"e3wd-hiBCcs","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Any Time!","track":{"id":"LMECrx3rd5U","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time/","slug":"any-time","title":"Any Time!","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/166.jpg","content":"ESTA., The Whooligan and Joe Kay five you a special sonic experiance.\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"xkgwVT5V7No","position":12,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Any Time!","track":{"id":"LMECrx3rd5U","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time/","slug":"any-time","title":"Any Time!","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/166.jpg","content":"ESTA., The Whooligan and Joe Kay five you a special sonic experiance.\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"s3dWfjbY_KA","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Any Time!","track":{"id":"LMECrx3rd5U","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time/","slug":"any-time","title":"Any Time!","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-169"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"-QXOYqw2_7w","position":89,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Down 4u","track":{"id":"ex5IVZ_UxlI","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/down-4u/","slug":"down-4u","title":"Down 4u","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/down-4u.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-169"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"QYV0E6kym10","position":19,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Dope Woods","track":{"id":"60hCEP6eYKU","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/dope-woods/","slug":"dope-woods","title":"Dope Woods","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/dope-woods.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Bd4yLv8Leyg","slug":"171","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-171"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #171","artwork":"/images/episodes/171.jpg","content":"Joe Kay returned with an immense amount and plenty of new ideas/inspiration after Coachella Weekend 1. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are so many new gems in here. We also recently discovered this new platform/label out of Sydney called: [@flowfi](https://soundcloud.com/flowfi) (Accidentally spelled them out wrong on the show as F-L-O), but these guys are coming with HEAT. Make sure you pay attention to them. If you feel this whole session please share. Lets keep educating people with real music. Catch you next week at the same time.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10801,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"whh4hic_ZrU","position":55,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Passear","track":{"id":"EqozSP_dt-0","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/passear/","slug":"passear","title":"Passear","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/passear.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-o3R3MpGKew","slug":"175","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-175-special-announcement"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #175 (Rinse FM Announcement)","artwork":"/images/episodes/175.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) & [iiike](https://soundcloud.com/iiike) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10894,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-14T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"NXBm53U-RZU","position":9,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - You want You need","track":{"id":"OVU15Hj0vxo","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/you-want-you-need/","slug":"you-want-you-need","title":"You want You need","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/you-want-you-need.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"RZtsdfDAG2Q","slug":"181","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-181-w-chris-mcclenney-the-whooligan"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #181 w/ Chris McClenney & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/181.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10839,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-07-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"HhBEcUgHFo0","position":10,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Dope Woods","track":{"id":"60hCEP6eYKU","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/dope-woods/","slug":"dope-woods","title":"Dope Woods","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/dope-woods.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"RZtsdfDAG2Q","slug":"181","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-181-w-chris-mcclenney-the-whooligan"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #181 w/ Chris McClenney & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/181.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10839,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-07-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"6drveJrnSUk","position":69,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Any Time!","track":{"id":"LMECrx3rd5U","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time/","slug":"any-time","title":"Any Time!","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-195"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10809,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"lxIqdr5afYg","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Kojack - Any Time!","track":{"id":"LMECrx3rd5U","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time/","slug":"any-time","title":"Any Time!","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/any-time.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F4e7aih12WM","slug":"199","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-199"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #199 (Best of 2014)","artwork":"/images/episodes/199.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11825,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-12-27T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"YbSfwqK3E8o","position":4,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"KOJACK - Kaio beat","track":{"id":"dFrIhbxUrGU","path":"/artists/kojack/tracks/kaio-beat/","slug":"kaio-beat","title":"Kaio beat","artist":{"slug":"kojack","title":"Kojack"},"artwork":"images/artists/kojack/tracks/kaio-beat.png"},"